<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Example<sp/>Overview</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">These<sp/>examples<sp/>demonstrate<sp/>three<sp/>different<sp/>approaches<sp/>to<sp/>implement<sp/>MCPWM<sp/>functionality:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>SysConfig-based<sp/>(mcpwm_ex1_basic_pwm.c<sp/>in<sp/>driverlib)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Manual<sp/>Driverlib<sp/>(mcpwm_ex4_basic_pwm_no_syscfg.c)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Direct<sp/>Register/Bitfield<sp/>(mcpwm_ex1_basic_pwm.c<sp/>in<sp/>examples_bitfield)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Common<sp/>Functionality</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">All<sp/>implementations<sp/>configure<sp/>myMCPWM0(MCPWM1)<sp/>and<sp/>myMCPWM1(MCPWM3)<sp/>as<sp/>follows:\n</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">**Common<sp/>Features<sp/>Across<sp/>All<sp/>Implementations**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>PWM<sp/>Generation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>10KHz<sp/>frequency<sp/>generation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Configurable<sp/>duty<sp/>cycle<sp/>updates</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Multiple<sp/>output<sp/>patterns</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Interrupt<sp/>Handling</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Event-triggered<sp/>updates</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Synchronized<sp/>compare<sp/>value<sp/>modifications</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Flexible<sp/>Output<sp/>Configurations</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Up<sp/>counting<sp/>and<sp/>Up-Down<sp/>counting<sp/>modes</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Multiple<sp/>compare<sp/>value<sp/>triggers</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Complementary<sp/>output<sp/>options</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>myMCPWM0<sp/>Configuration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Time<sp/>Base<sp/>Settings:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Up<sp/>Count<sp/>Mode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>10KHz<sp/>Frequency<sp/>PWM</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Action<sp/>Qualifier<sp/>Outputs:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>A1:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>at<sp/>zero,<sp/>Low<sp/>at<sp/>CMPA</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>B1:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>at<sp/>zero,<sp/>Low<sp/>at<sp/>CMPB</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>A2:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>at<sp/>CMPA,<sp/>Low<sp/>at<sp/>Period</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>B2:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>at<sp/>CMPB,<sp/>Low<sp/>at<sp/>Period</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>A3:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>at<sp/>CMPA,<sp/>Low<sp/>at<sp/>CMPB</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>B3:<sp/>Set<sp/>Low<sp/>at<sp/>CMPA,<sp/>High<sp/>at<sp/>CMPB</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Interrupt<sp/>Configuration:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>ET1<sp/>triggers<sp/>every<sp/>5<sp/>&quot;Counter<sp/>=<sp/>Period&quot;<sp/>events<sp/>and<sp/>is<sp/>selected<sp/>as<sp/>source<sp/>of<sp/>Interrupt</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Updates<sp/>CMPx<sp/>values<sp/>at<sp/>runtime</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>myMCPWM1<sp/>Configuration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Time<sp/>Base<sp/>Settings:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Up-Down<sp/>Count<sp/>Mode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>10KHz<sp/>Frequency<sp/>PWM</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Action<sp/>Qualifier<sp/>Outputs:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>A1:<sp/>High<sp/>at<sp/>CMPA<sp/>up,<sp/>Low<sp/>at<sp/>CMPA<sp/>down</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>B1:<sp/>High<sp/>at<sp/>CMPB<sp/>up,<sp/>Low<sp/>at<sp/>CMPB<sp/>down</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Interrupt<sp/>Configuration:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>ET1<sp/>triggers<sp/>every<sp/>5<sp/>&quot;Counter<sp/>=<sp/>Period&quot;<sp/>events<sp/>and<sp/>is<sp/>selected<sp/>as<sp/>source<sp/>of<sp/>Interrupt</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Updates<sp/>CMPx<sp/>values<sp/>at<sp/>runtime</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
